      ],
      "image": "assets/images/254978/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk water and cornstarch together in a small bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/U7ObdjLr8vJ4B6Sq0abozdrrfhE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/254978-jersey-fresh-stewed-tomatoes-ddmfs-Step4-1904-63bef4df87194bc29906a1d0388d3012.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/254978/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir into the skillet. Simmer tomato mixture until thickened, about 5 minutes. Serve warm and enjoy.",
